  "openQuestions": [
    "Variant switching: Webflow props cannot toggle combo classes. Use Webflow component variants (base, left, left-offset) on the one component, or leave the component unvariant and apply is-left / is-offset per instance after unlinking? Recommendation: component variants.",
    "Heading size per instance (heading-style-h3 vs h4) has the same problem as variant switching; recommendation: fold it into the component variant (base uses h4, wellness instance overrides via its own variant or accepts h4).",
    "Placeholder fill #D9D9D9 has no variable (263 uses site-wide). Create a shared color-placeholder variable in K01, or keep the raw hex on image-trio-text_figure?",
    "Are the grey cards on dining, legal and corporate placeholders for photos to come, or intended as empty blocks? The plan treats them as image slots with a grey fallback.",
    "The Figma copy on legal/03 contains em dashes; the plan uses commas instead. Confirm the copy wording.",
    "text-style-eyebrow-caps: Q001 may create it during token sync; this plan reuses Q001's if present, otherwise creates it with the values here. K01 reconciles.",
